{"sourceUrl":"https://atmsci.fudan.edu.cn/f7/8b/c14829a784267/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:34.067070+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://atmsci.fudan.edu.cn/f7/8b/c14829a784267/page.htm","html":"<div>\n<div><div><div><div>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://atmsci.fudan.edu.cn/4e/c8/c14903a151240/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"图片\">\n<img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://atmsci.fudan.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/b6/64/21b139db4882a156a1db84509ce1/7ec04eb3-5500-46fb-b330-1f3a5140649e.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n</div></div></div></div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://atmsci.fudan.edu.cn/annoucement/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"通知公告\">通知公告</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://atmsci.fudan.edu.cn/rctz/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"院系通知\">院系通知</a></td>\n</tr>\n</table><table>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://atmsci.fudan.edu.cn/cyxx/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"常用信息\">常用信息</a></td>\n</tr>\n</table><table>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://atmsci.fudan.edu.cn/zsgg/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"招生公告\">招生公告</a></td>\n</tr>\n</table><table>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://atmsci.fudan.edu.cn/zpgg/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"招聘公告\">招聘公告</a></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\r\n       您当前的位置:<a href=\"https://atmsci.fudan.edu.cn/main.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">首页</a><span>  </span><a href=\"https://atmsci.fudan.edu.cn/annoucement/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">通知公告</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<div>\r\n                                \r\n                                  复旦大学大气与海洋科学系2026年全国优秀大学生开放日报名通知\r\n                                \r\n                             </div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>发布时间:\r\n                   <span>\n<span>\r\n                     \r\n                      2026-06-24\r\n                      \r\n                     </span>\n</span>\n</td></tr></tbody>\n</table>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<span>\n<span>\n<p></p><p><br/></p><p><span>为促进全国高校</span><span>2027</span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生之间的交流，增进对我单位研究生教育的深入了解，激发同学们对大气科学、海洋科学的兴趣，特举办本次开放日活动。欢迎有意向报考复旦大学大气与海洋科学系直博生的同学们参加开放日活动，也欢迎相关同学们参加我系</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日国际暑期学校活动。报名阶段相关事宜通知如下：</span></p><p><span>      一、报名时间</span></p><p><span>即日起至</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>2</span><span>日</span><span>15:00</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>二、报名条件</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>全国各高等学校</span><span>2027</span><span>年应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>学业成绩优秀，本科前</span><span>3</span><span>年</span><span>(</span><span>或前</span><span>5</span><span>学期</span><span>)</span><span>成绩排名位居本校同年级本专业前列。 </span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>具有较强的学术创新或实践应用能力。</span></p><p><span>三、报名材料</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版</span><span>JPG</span><span>格式，</span><span>150×200</span><span>像素，大小</span><span>500K</span><span>以内。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>本科阶段现有完整成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章），</span><span>JPG</span><span>或</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>外语水平证明，如</span><span>CET-4</span><span>、</span><span>CET-6</span><span>、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作。</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>个人自述（包括个人简历、本科期间学习科研工作简介、对未来读研和职业规划的初步设想，</span><span>1</span><span>页</span><span>A4</span><span>纸）。</span></p><p><span>6.</span><span>成绩排名证明（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）。</span></p><p><span>四、报名方式</span></p><p><span>申请人登录复旦大学研究生招生网（</span><span>https://gsao.fudan.edu.cn</span><span>）</span><span>,</span><span>通过“研究生报考服务系统”中的“全国优秀大学生夏令营</span><span>/</span><span>学术营”进行网上报名，无须寄送纸质材料。</span></p><p><span>五、相关说明</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>本次活动举办时间暂定为</span><span><strong>7</strong></span><span><strong>月</strong></span><span><strong>8</strong></span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span><span>，</span></span></span><span><strong>7</strong></span><span><strong>月</strong></span><span><strong>4</strong></span><span><span><span><strong>日左右</strong></span><span>发布入营营员名单，活动规模</span></span></span><span>50-80</span><span>人。活动内容包括校史馆参观、院系介绍、师生面对面交流等，具体安排另行通知。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>申请人应承诺填报信息和提交材料的真实性。如有弄虚作假，一经发现将取消申请 资格并通报其本科院校。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>本次活动院系仅负责餐饮，往返交通费、住宿费自理。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>如果上级部门和学校关于活动有新要求，我单位将按新要求执行并及时通知申请人。</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>咨询方式：</span><span>021-31248810</span><span>，</span><span><a href=\"mailto:wrp@fudan.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">wrp@fudan.edu.cn</a></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>复旦大学大气与海洋科学系</span></p><p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</span>\n</span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"073fe4b3f4c525b8e307fc44ea17a1a982704e046de386e58772da90e9b9f0ba","textLength":915,"sourceSha256":"01ca40c1747888a01c6a97d1bb394f0a31d240ddf7fabc308a7683d273b71f3e","selector":"article-like:content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a29a3ac931ff924f963e","title":"2026年复旦大学大气与海洋科学系2026年全国优秀大学生开放日报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:34.067070+00:00"}
